cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "offroad-control: terrain- and latency-aware control on deformable terrain"
abstract: >-
  A modular, latency-aware framework for shared and autonomous control of HMMWVs
  on deformable terrain, built on Project Chrono's SCM (Soil Contact Model)
  plant: terrain-aware NMPC over a single-tire-rig neural surrogate, joint online
  estimation of the Bekker exponent and friction angle from vehicle and inertial
  signals alone, intent-preserving reactive and predictive safety filters, and
  human-in-the-loop teleoperation under measurement-grounded 5G command and
  camera latency.
